{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"61e08bddef971fa4afa3787b74e7d0f60c39d35575be775cd040ae8d07eccf61"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:c4a026dae2e168c66a1720dae71633c4d57209759951cf666a1c90e71fd96a16","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of her scripts that dealt with emotional themes","evidence":"[D14:1 | 5:44 pm on 3 June, 2022] Joanna: Nate, after finishing my screenplay I got a rejection letter from a major company. It really bummed me out.\n[D3:1 | 9:27 am on 7 February, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! The screenplay I sent in to the film festival has been on my mind all day everyday. I keep bouncing between crazy emotions like relief, excitement and worry! Fingers crossed a producer or director falls in love with it and it ends up on the big screen - that would be awesome!\n[D2:7 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: Woohoo, Nate! I'm feeling a rollercoaster of emotions - relief, excitement, some anxiety - over finishing this project. Now I'm gonna submit it to some film festivals and (hopefully) get producers and directors to check it out. Here's hoping!\n[D24:12 | 2:01 pm on 21 October, 2022] Joanna: Well, I had a bit of a setback recently - another rejection from a production company.\n[D24:13 | 2:01 pm on 21 October, 2022] Nate: Bummer, Joanna. Is this the one you sent to a film contest? Rejections suck, but don't forget they don't define you. Keep at it and you'll find the perfect opportunity.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bff2a516-6d7c-51ba-8f4b-4c9aec2fdf4a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:041ecea49baad227ccd45150e80c916bfb8387fedb6eca48fd6cd0a87b4fde36","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which of Joanna's screenplay were rejected from production companies?","referenceAnswer":"first screenplay on drama and romance, third screenplay on loss identity and connection","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"041ecea49baad227ccd45150e80c916bfb8387fedb6eca48fd6cd0a87b4fde36"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}